WEBVTT

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:16.060
<i>When the red-stained night comes</i>

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:21.270
<i>I paint you on the sky</i>

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:31.670
"KING's RAID:
Successors of the Will"

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:36.150
<i>The hidden truth</i>

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.690
<i>The sudden suffocation</i>

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:45.940
<i>You are so distant, fading</i>

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:50.600
<i>Do you feel it too?</i>

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>Crossing blades</i>

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:55.770
<i>Cannot touch</i>

00:00:55.770 --> 00:01:00.400
<i>The sadness that lies beyond</i>

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.900
<i>I just want to see you</i>

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:06.850
<i>I search for you</i>

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:10.270
<i>Now, Eclipse</i>

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:15.190
<i>I always want to be by your side</i>

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:17.850
<i>I send a wish to the sky</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:20.060
<i>I believe in destiny</i>

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:22.480
<i>When the sun and moon meet</i>

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:24.940
<i>At that moment</i>

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:28.150
<i>I run to you</i>

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:32.020
<i>With all my heart</i>

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:45.910
<i></i>Those Who

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:45.910
<i></i>Stand Firm

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.350
It's been a long time, Behl.

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:50.980
I'm sure Demia has already
informed you of this,

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:55.440
but I am currently in
the Tower of the Sage with Riheet.

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:58.770
I can see you frowning in my mind.

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:03.270
I'm sure you're worried sick for me.

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:06.020
But please don't worry.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:10.190
I'm safe, and also, I was able to get
some useful information from Dominix

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:13.650
about how to defeat the Dark Lord.

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:18.520
Before I talk about that though,
there's something I must tell you.

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:20.730
It's about the Black Edge.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:27.980
What is that...?

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:34.190
We sent the Black Edge to
the Galluah Plains as the vanguard.

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:37.190
They encountered Demons
and were completely routed.

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:39.600
No...

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:44.650
Check for survivors.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:45.940
Yes!

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.400
Riheet!

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.810
Hold it together! Riheet!

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:59.980
We were forced to retreat
and arrived at a village.

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:05.310
Riheet, you were the only survivor.

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:17.230
If you're trying to go
to Galluah Plains, don't.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.400
You're only asking to get yourself killed!

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:24.940
That won't make your friends come back.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:27.810
You won't even be able to avenge them!

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.440
Don't die, Riheet...

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:33.440
You know better than anyone
how valuable a life is...!

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:46.060
The value of life?

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:52.230
Who took innocent lives
and tormented us? It's Orvelia!

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:54.980
Oh, kind princess.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:04:02.560
You pretend to understand yet know nothing.

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:06.810
You've never had a loved one
murdered before your eyes.

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:10.900
You've never been treated like a pest.

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:12.850
What are you talking about...?

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:19.100
We were a gathering of those who had
their families killed by Orvelia.

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:22.770
No...! There must be some mistake!

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:28.270
There is no mistake! We were massacred!

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:33.690
Our mothers, fathers, siblings!

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:39.900
Our hometowns were burned to the ground.
We didn't even have a home to return to!

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:44.020
We hate Orvelia far more
than we hate the Demons!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:55.770
I should probably keep
that incident to myself...

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:58.980
So, this is regarding the Dark Lord
and how to defeat him, yes?

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:00.560
Yes.

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:03.150
Let me get straight to the point.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.520
The only way to defeat the Dark Lord
is by using the Holy Sword Aea,

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:10.810
which carries the power of Lua,
the Goddess of Light.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:15.940
But the Holy Sword is nowhere to be found.

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:18.060
Are you sure there's no other way?

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:22.690
We sealed the Holy Sword in a secret location.

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:26.310
Seal...? So it still exists?

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:27.230
Yes.

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:29.690
Where is the Holy Sword now...?

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:31.650
The World Tree.

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:35.810
The World Tree...
Why didn't you tell us until now?

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:38.730
To protect the Holy Sword from the Demons.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:41.480
Also, we needed to hide the fact that

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:47.770
the Holy Sword Aea and its potential heir exist.

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:49.440
Heir...?

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:59.600
What do you want?

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:01.850
I read this, too.

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:06.310
Illya's research was all about
protecting King Kyle.

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:10.690
This diary is full of her thoughts
towards King Kyle.

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:13.980
I want the people of Orvelia
to learn about this.

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:17.850
Do as you like.
It has nothing to do with me.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:21.690
Riheet, what are you going to do now?

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:28.230
If possible, I'd like you to join us as
a Guardian Knight to defeat the Dark Lord.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:32.770
How soft are you?
What makes you think I'll help you?

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:36.770
Leave me alone.

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:39.310
I can't do that.

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:42.900
Why, to atone for Orvelia's sins?

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:45.100
Or do you feel sorry for me?

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:50.190
Neither. This is for Orvelia's future!

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:55.020
We must right the wrongs and improve
our relations with the Dark Elves.

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:58.480
Otherwise, similar tragedies will occur again.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:06.150
I want to change Orvelia into a nation
where the people can live in peace...

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:09.980
For that, we need the help
of the Dark Elves.

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:13.940
Riheet, I need your help!

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:17.150
The False Sword we were
looking for didn't exist.

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:21.270
The world will end by the hands of
the Dark Lord before you can do anything.

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:26.270
There is still hope!
The Holy Sword Aea still exists.

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:38.060
I vowed to protect Orvelia and its people,
in place of my ailing father.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:43.770
To do that, I must first defeat
the resurrected Demon Lord.

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:47.850
The only hope is the Holy Sword Aea.

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:53.600
I have decided to travel to the World Tree
to fight alongside the Holy Sword's heir.

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:59.850
While I do that, I want you
to support the Guardian Knights.

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:03.600
May the blessing of the light
shine on Orvelia.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.230
Selene!

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:16.650
What's wrong? I can take watch by myself.

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:19.150
Don't be like that.

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:21.850
Let's chat a little!

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:24.350
What do you mean, "chat"?

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:28.940
The three of us talking about things
without the boys!

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.730
There's no time for that...

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:35.770
We have to depart for the World Tree
the moment the sun rises.

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:40.400
That's exactly why we should be
deepening our relationship.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:41.520
Right?

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.480
Um, yes...

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:47.440
Miss Selene, I've always wanted
to spend some time talking to you.

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:52.230
We barely had the opportunity
to talk in the Forest of Elidora.

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:57.810
To be honest, I also wanted to talk to you.

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:03.350
I haven't heard what happened
after you left the Forest of Elidora.

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:07.600
Oh, all sorts of things happened!
It was a lot of work!

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:14.020
We did make it to the Orc village,
but there was a new chief--Chief Sieg.

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:16.520
Chief Aeatola was no longer the chief?

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:23.600
Exactly. I guess Master Lorraine didn't know
Chief Aeatola had passed away.

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:28.850
Master Lorraine hadn't seen
Chief Aeatola for 100 years, so...

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:33.060
But still, Chief Sieg did unlock
the second seal for us.

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:37.350
Seriously though, who would've guessed
Kasel would end up like that?

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:38.900
Yes...

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:41.810
It was just as Master Lorraine said.

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:45.600
The power of the Holy Sword
that now resides in Kasel

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:51.310
is so powerful that it could put Kasel himself
and those around him in danger.

00:09:51.310 --> 00:09:54.980
I don't clearly remember what happened
while I was on the rampage, but...

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:59.730
I was full of rage and hate towards
the Demons, or something like that.

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:03.650
I remember feeling like I wasn't myself anymore.

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:05.690
Kasel...

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:09.230
It's different from the time I fought
the Demon in the Forest of Elidora.

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:12.770
This time, I was completely gone.

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:17.520
I've been pursuing pure power,
so that I can get stronger, but...

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:20.520
I think that's not good enough.

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:26.600
If I let my own heart defeat me,
I can't correctly use the Holy Sword's power.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:30.900
But I think meeting Reina
helped him get over it.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:38.190
You need to live for yourself.
Otherwise, your heart will die.

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:41.100
Heart... Die...?

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:44.480
I might not look like one,
but I'm a noble's daughter.

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:49.100
The expectation was that one day,
I'd marry another noble for political gain.

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:51.690
That was the expectation, no alternative.

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:55.150
It was suffocating, and I suffered every day.

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:59.520
But one day, I realized.
There's more than one future.

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:01.900
I'm the one that gets to decide.

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:06.270
And now, I live free,
and I'm happy every day!

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:11.230
Kasel, you should break free from
your duties and responsibilities and stuff.

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:22.480
Miss Reina!

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:25.020
Kasel! Run!

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:30.850
I won't run... Never!

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:46.980
I see...

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:49.150
Perhaps the fact that
he overcame those obstacles

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:52.810
could be part of why he seems
more reliable than before.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:56.850
Do you think so, too?
Do you think Kasel is more reliable?

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:58.600
Y-Yes...

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:01.980
I think he has matured,
as the warrior of the Holy Sword.

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:06.560
I know right?! I thought so, too! Right Frey?

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:08.190
Huh?

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:10.650
What...?

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:16.850
Y-Yes, I also think Kasel
appears more reliable now.

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:19.980
Kasel has the power of
the Holy Sword within him.

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:26.560
But it's still up to him whether or not
he can wield that power properly.

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:30.230
If he appears more reliable, perhaps it's
not just the power of the Holy Sword,

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:32.900
but a stronger heart.

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.440
Heart...?

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:38.600
Also, he has you...

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:42.190
Just like Master Lorraine and
the other heroes supported King Kyle,

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:44.600
Kasel has you to support him.

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:47.730
Perhaps that's how he is able
to have a strong heart.

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:51.270
Are you saying we're heroes, too...?

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:52.310
Yes.

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:56.650
Th-That's flattering,
but I've never thought of it that way!

00:12:56.650 --> 00:13:01.850
Right... A hero? We're not that impressive.

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:05.480
We're just friends supporting
each other in battle.

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:06.980
Friends...

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:08.730
Yes.

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:15.270
After that, we met Master Pavel,
to unlock the final seal.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:19.730
The peace that King Kyle
wanted to protect hasn't vanished yet.

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:24.690
I'll never give up on everyone--
on this world!

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:33.810
Your son is just like you.

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:36.520
Kasel.

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:42.100
You seem to have inherited the strong will
of both King Kyle and Arlette.

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:43.900
Master Pavel...

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:48.850
It is no longer possible to stop
the Dark Lord's return.

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:52.940
The nocturnal sun overlaps
the moon tonight.

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:54.100
No...

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.310
What should we do?!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:01.350
We should get the Holy Sword!

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:06.480
If we can't stop him from returning,
we can defeat him!

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:07.520
That's right!

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:08.980
Yes!

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:10.600
Yeah.

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:13.270
I'll unseal the Holy Sword. Let's go.

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:15.480
Huh? Go where?

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:19.060
The World Tree. That's where
the Holy Sword is sealed.

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:24.730
The World Tree?
The most holy place in the world?

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:26.100
Yes.

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:30.480
The World Tree is one of
the pillars supporting the world.

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:34.350
If it is destroyed, the world would collapse.

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:39.560
That's why a holy power protects
the World Tree and the surrounding area.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:43.730
I never imagined that
the World Tree had such a secret...

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:46.600
Normal Demons would not even
be able to get close.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.980
But the Dark Lord might...

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:54.440
If the Holy Sword fell into the hands
of the Dark Lord, it would be trouble.

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:55.520
Let's hurry.

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:56.560
Yes.

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:58.190
There's no more escape for you.

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:00.150
Malduk!

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:01.480
Is that...?

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:09.310
Who is that?

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:12.730
Ah... Let me introduce.

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:19.310
This is the Dark Lord Angmund,
who arrived from the dimensional rift.

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:20.940
The Dark Lord Angmund!

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:22.520
That's him?!

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:01.940
We survived...

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:04.730
Why did you help us?

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:09.400
He needs care quickly.

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:17.770
It has been a long time, Maria...

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:21.980
Oh, you can tell who I am?
Impressive, Lorraine.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:31.400
Why the sad look?
Why not celebrate our 100-year reunion?

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:36.770
You were a saintess, but now you're a Demon...

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:38.310
Saintess...?

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:44.600
Let's get inside before we continue.

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:54.020
So? There must be a reason why
this lady saved us.

00:17:54.020 --> 00:17:57.190
She said she wanted to talk to Kasel.

00:17:57.190 --> 00:17:58.520
Talk?

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:04.690
Truth is a very cruel thing.
If you think you're ready to hear it...

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:15.690
I became a Demon, and started
to search for a way to rescue Kyle.

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:19.400
But there was no such way.

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:21.810
That's why I thought,
if the dimensional rift could be opened again,

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:28.560
I can enter the world of darkness,
and I can go look for Kyle there.

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:31.480
To save King Kyle.

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:32.600
Yes.

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:33.730
Maria...

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:38.060
We share your desire to save King Kyle.

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:42.980
Then perhaps we can fight
the Dark Lord together, too.

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:45.940
Lea would not allow that.

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:48.690
I wouldn't be able to forgive myself either.

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:50.060
Besides...

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.560
Things aren't that simple.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:57.690
The dimensional rift opened
for the first time in 100 years.

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:01.810
And out came Kyle,
who I had been waiting for...

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:03.060
King Kyle?!

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:05.230
He is alive?!

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:08.650
Kyle did appear before me.

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:11.020
As the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:16.480
Wait... So the person we fought was...

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:18.850
That is Kyle, who is now the Dark Lord.

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:26.560
Kyle has been infested by dark forces
and has become the Dark Lord.

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:27.940
But...

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:32.940
If King Kyle is just under
the influence of dark powers,

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:35.600
maybe there's a way to save him.

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:40.100
Don't have hope.
It tends to change into despair.

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:42.600
Lua will not save you.

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:45.980
I don't know about the goddess Lua...

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:47.690
But hope...

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:50.940
Hope, I think, is something
you have to hold on to!

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:56.810
I will get the Holy Sword,
and I will rescue King Kyle!

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:06.560
Master Pavel. Are you all right?

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:10.150
In my current state, I will be a burden.

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:11.900
There's no other choice.

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:14.560
I will unlock the final seal now.

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:48.190
Kasel. Get the Holy Sword,
before the Dark Lord--before Malduk!

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:49.350
Yes!

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:57.480
If what Miss Maria said is true, Kasel is...

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:05.310
I don't know what's true
and what's not. But...

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:10.440
In battle, hesitation is death.

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:14.810
If we fight the Dark Lord in our
current state, it could be fatal for us.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:21.980
I've always decided that I will
protect Kasel, no matter what.

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:26.480
You're strong.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:31.650
I used to have a prejudice against humans.

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:36.020
Kasel was the one who changed
my skewed point of view.

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:42.150
Watching him made me think, perhaps
human strength is strength of the heart...

00:21:47.350 --> 00:21:51.400
I-It's gotten quite late.

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:53.600
Yes.

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:55.600
Cleo fell asleep.

00:21:55.600 --> 00:21:58.850
We'll go to sleep now, Miss Selene.

00:21:59.900 --> 00:22:02.100
Just Selene is fine.

00:22:02.100 --> 00:22:05.650
Yes, I understand, Selene.

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:19.190
<i>This one wish</i>

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:21.900
<i>Connects you and me</i>

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:24.690
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:28.730
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:22:40.150 --> 00:22:45.270
<i>A comfortable breeze passes over</i>

00:22:45.270 --> 00:22:51.190
<i>A memory in a precious place</i>

00:22:51.190 --> 00:22:55.810
<i>From the day I decided to walk with you</i>

00:22:55.810 --> 00:23:02.480
<i>The promise that I hid in my heart</i>

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:07.940
<i>I want to feel that moment, just once</i>

00:23:07.940 --> 00:23:10.230
<i>If I stretch my arm out</i>

00:23:10.230 --> 00:23:13.600
<i>I should be able to reach</i>
<i>the tomorrow in my dream</i>

00:23:13.600 --> 00:23:16.270
<i>This one wish</i>

00:23:16.270 --> 00:23:19.150
<i>I gently engrave in my heart</i>

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:21.900
<i>The chain that connects the heart</i>

00:23:21.900 --> 00:23:24.690
<i>Cannot ever be broken</i>

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:27.480
<i>The future which we should head to</i>

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:30.270
<i>Beckons us to come closer</i>

00:23:30.270 --> 00:23:33.100
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:23:33.100 --> 00:23:36.060
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:50.270
Riheet's hatred towards Malduk grows.

00:23:50.270 --> 00:23:55.940
He tries to get the Holy Sword Aea,
in order to seek further strength, but...

00:23:55.940 --> 00:24:00.650
What he gains at the end of the battle is...

00:23:58.830 --> 00:24:00.830
<i></i>Blade of Vengeance,

00:23:58.830 --> 00:24:00.830
<i></i>Blooms in Darkness
